{
  "_readme": [
    "Shared test vectors for the odds arithmetic.",
    "",
    "The same formulas exist twice: backend/arbengine/odds.py, and a TypeScript",
    "port in frontend/lib/staticMath.ts that keeps the calculators interactive on",
    "the static demo. Two implementations of one formula drift, and they had:",
    "calcConvert(0, 'american') returned {decimal: Infinity} in TypeScript where",
    "Python raised, and the demo backtest silently dropped per-venue void rates.",
    "",
    "Both suites assert against this file, so a divergence fails a test instead of",
    "reaching a user. Python: backend/tests/test_shared_vectors.py.",
    "TypeScript: frontend/lib/__tests__/sharedVectors.test.ts."
  ],
